But, um, you know, I remembered HTTP UV, which is the, the web server we had to write

00:27:43.739 --> 00:27:47.939
for R, uh, that was like a lot of C++ code.

00:27:47.939 --> 00:27:53.140
It wraps the lib UV library and then, um, imports, uh, some HTTP parsing code that I

00:27:53.140 --> 00:27:54.619
think Ryan Dahl live coded.

