00:29:25.619 --> 00:29:33.300
right, like you're very unafraid of being like crystal clear about like, you know,

00:29:33.500 --> 00:29:34.339
you have that opinion.

00:29:34.380 --> 00:29:35.060
That's okay.

00:29:35.979 --> 00:29:36.819
I get to decide.

00:29:36.819 --> 00:29:38.140
